# Mobile binding shells: generated source (.kt/.swift) + native libs + the
# xcframework are regenerated in CI from the uniffi crate — git is not the
# artifact store (binding-repo architecture plan §1.3).
# Android (bindings/kotlin/): generated Kotlin + per-ABI .so + Gradle output
